{"id":"bewusstsein","lemma":"Bewusstsein","pos":"noun","rank":2421,"glosses":["consciousness, awareness"],"ipa":"/bəˈvʊstzaɪ̯n/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/De-Bewusstsein.oga/De-Bewusstsein.oga.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Bewusstseins"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie verlor plötzlich das Bewusstsein.","en":"She suddenly lost consciousness.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to lose","l":"verlieren"},{"g":"suddenly, abruptly"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Ich glaube, ich habe das Bewusstsein verloren.","en":"I think I lost consciousness.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Er war einige Tage ohne Bewusstsein.","en":"He was unconscious for several days.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"period"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Er kam im Krankenhaus wieder zu Bewusstsein.","en":"He regained consciousness in the hospital.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"hospital"},{"g":"again"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Ist Tom bei Bewusstsein?","en":"Is Tom conscious?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"at / with"},null]}]}